# With completed hidden, the new task still goes last, after the project's hidden done child, and shows.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Open item
	- Done item @done(2026-10-01)
END
keys gc
hide Done item
keys q
type Next item
keys <Enter>
see - Next item
hide Done item
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Open item
	- Done item @done(2026-10-01)
	- Next item
END
